        "point": "M ≤ 1",
        "statement": "When M ≤ 1, VTask.stolzSet M = ∅; the angular inequality cannot be satisfied for any z in the open unit disc.",
        "note": "Follows from the reverse triangle inequality: ‖1 − z‖ ≥ 1 − ‖z‖ ≥ M * (1 − ‖z‖) when M ≤ 1 and ‖z‖ < 1."
      },
      {
        "point": "M ≤ 0",
        "statement": "When M ≤ 0, VTask.stolzSet M = ∅; the right-hand side M * (1 − ‖z‖) is non-positive while ‖1 − z‖ > 0.",
        "note": "Subsumed by the M ≤ 1 case but worth noting for completeness."
      }
    ]
  },
